{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My Foster writes: Unfortunately Ivy is the perfect cat, very fortunate to you but as her foster it will be difficult to let her go. She is truly one of the sweetest cats I've ever know. While writing this she even plopped down in my lap to get her head and neckscratches in. With trust built, she even enjoys gently belly rubs. Ivy is very polite, social, and can be vocal. She will announce her presence and dislike for being alone. Ivy will be your little shadow and want to accompany you everywhere as she is very very explorative. She's a curious girl and enjoys looking out the window at birds so access to this will make her the happiest kitty ever.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=11&searchType=4&animalid=207621","id":"385726616cef6ab92ee439c1b1043835","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5ab97b504a16475da719d7bd668a855b-1794433663-1794433669-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/c6056d9594c54e4990ace8f1068dd4b8-1794433664-1794433664-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/4d9fd4d0d6874b40a817c7721e420527-1794433664-1794433664-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/b05376c8a4344e3ba823dbf2d5331f60-1794433664-1794433664-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/fd91121ffe134f4a8c97e15964c2c2c6-1794433663-1794433663-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/c8444db48cca4810bde0108260b66fbb-1794433662-1794433662-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/24c4556ff15b445a99d60e57d07ccf9b-1794433662-1794433662-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/8d3fa60286f14